{"id":"214ddac8d92e582e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-recursively-enumerable.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable","display":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-recursively-enumerable","aliases":["92-df-recursively-enumerable"],"display":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-recursively-enumerable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-recursively-enumerable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-recursively-enumerable-—-Recursively-Enumerable-$W_e$\">df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(S \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> (definition target recursively-enumerable predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computable-enumerability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash \\mathrm{RE}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash \\mathrm{RE}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}(S)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>是递归可枚举的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>个递归可枚举集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>个部分递归函数</li>\n<li>对自然数标准模型中的子集，递归可枚举等价于可由某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span> 公式定义（允许数值参数时须同时固定参数约定）</li>\n<li>这一等价来自计算的正规形与算术可表示性结果，不是“一阶逻辑完备性定理”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-recursively-enumerable-—-Recursively-Enumerable-$W_e$","text":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable $W_e$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computable-enumerability predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"S \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"t